# Template. Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored, this file is not.
#
# Deliberately NOT prefixed with VITE_. Vite inlines every VITE_* variable into the
# client bundle, which would publish the key to anyone who opens the site. This name
# is only ever read by Node in scripts/generate-art.mjs at authoring time, so the key
# stays on your machine and never reaches the browser or the build output.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
